      <div class="mini"><div class="ln"></div><div class="tp"></div></div>
      <div class="itn">解温度场 T（三对角隐式）</div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="ln"></div><div class="tp"></div></div>
      <div class="itn">用新 T 更新 Arrhenius 扩散 D(C,T)</div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="ln"></div><div class="tp"></div></div>
      <div class="itn">解水分场 C（三对角隐式）</div>
